                                    <font key="font" metaFont="system"/>
                                    <string key="title">MacMulator is the computer emulator for your Mac! It engages the power of Qemu and Apple Virtualization Framework, together with a nice, easy to use UI, to let you create any kind of Virtual Machines in a few clicks. Whatever OS you need to run on your Mac, MacMulator is the tool for you!</string>
